---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="About Mago" description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
  </head>
  <body class="w-full max-w-screen-md mx-auto my-4 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 transition-colors duration-300">
    <Header />
    <main class="px-4 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">About Mago</h1>
      <img src="/vague.jpg" alt="Vague, a watercolor self-portrait by Mago" />
      <p>
        Mago is a self-taught artist. She calls her work naïve: its meaning lies close
        to the surface, with little to unravel and plenty to feel.
      </p>
      <p>
        She likes the mundane, the supposedly boring—a cup, a pair of shoes, an afternoon
        with nowhere to go. She paints nudes and erotic scenes, too. Ordinary life has
        its small luxuries; looking closely is one of them.
      </p>
      <p>
        For her, painting is a pleasure in itself. She enjoys every part: the first mark,
        the wrong turn, the slow arrival of colour. The finished picture is only part of it.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
